{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_015siz0544_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_015siz0544_1000_p", "source_sha256": "5e5be6cbbc5219f3267a11d451a71c39adcba3a8776404b9a62e7d1142274a3a", "ja": "（静香がプロデュースした服の発売に先だって、\nティーン向けの雑誌に載せる写真を撮影している）", "zh": "（在静香亲自设计的服装发售前，正在为刊登在面向青少年的杂志上的照片进行拍摄。）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_015siz0544_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_015siz0544_1001_p", "source_sha256": "02e1dd83bb6e3cd125cb524f854639ed86d6e586a7c5172b32e09216865b9d33", "ja": "お疲れさま、静香。\n予定より早く進んでるし、このままなら……。", "zh": "辛苦了，静香。\n进度比预定的还要快，照这样下去……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_015siz0544_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_015siz0544_1002_015siz", "source_sha256": "3b528e53fec335dbddef477fc30cb3782c6b0859ea7b675c84229d6956fef79b", "ja": "{$P$}、止まってください！\nそれ以上、近くに来ないでもらえますか……。", "zh": "{$P$}，请停下！\n可以请你不要再靠近了吗……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_015siz0544_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_015siz0544_1003_p", "source_sha256": "0d4f7dfcf2a17e4b09776eaed910bffe6898494b3d732e53e27b6722c3612b1d", "ja": "え？　あ、ごめん！\nちょっと近づきすぎたな……気をつけるよ。", "zh": "咦？啊，抱歉！\n我是不是靠得太近了……我会注意的。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_015siz0544_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_015siz0544_1004_015siz", "source_sha256": "46c6d772537432dd2548cd09bae8acfe76d970ac9a67f4ab02e1b51b53af7e2f", "ja": "あっ。その、違うんです。{$P$}に\n近づかれるのが、嫌というわけじゃなくて……。", "zh": "啊。那个，不是这样的。并不是讨厌{$P$}靠近我，  \n只是……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_015siz0544_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_015siz0544_1005_015siz", "source_sha256": "21bb6a3c643ff8a26960b36b951d779c5ba3366a1b017a6388e9d4a26f25ed00", "ja": "集中したいというか……。撮影が終わるまでは\nちょっと距離を取っておきたいんです。", "zh": "该说是想集中精神吧……在拍摄结束之前，我想暂时保持一点距离。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_015siz0544_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_015siz0544_1006_015siz", "source_sha256": "e516ba0aec0490f4e17cc712318df72a8bf9a16948f4dd9549fe409d59cd16d3", "ja": "今日はこの服に合わせて、\n大人っぽくてカッコいい私でいたいんです。", "zh": "今天想配合这身衣服，保持成熟又帅气的状态。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_015siz0544_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_015siz0544_1007_015siz", "source_sha256": "dd8f231edbcc048203159a65b1558f5743ed5cdf037fea5791859acd4ee51941", "ja": "そのためには、できるだけ\n気を抜かないようにしないといけませんから。", "zh": "所以，我得尽量不能有半点松懈才行。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_015siz0544_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_015siz0544_1008_p", "source_sha256": "fed6b7f56cee5192808c924d6da8f64a7c8dc39b8d0441c17bd658cea313ecb2", "ja": "そうか……。でも、静香はいつもしっかりしてるし、\n気を抜いてるイメージはないけどなぁ。", "zh": "这样啊……不过，静香一直都很认真，\n我倒没觉得她有放松警惕的时候。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_015siz0544_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_015siz0544_1009_015siz", "source_sha256": "397be0b9be27ea01d8cc4dc9f081ac1cb3842d1b3d96f8ae535010eb85b4d0a6", "ja": "ええっ！　もう忘れたんですか！？\nその、えっと……。", "zh": "诶！已经忘了吗！？\n那个，呃……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_015siz0544_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_015siz0544_1010_p", "source_sha256": "74e5a660be27518403adee51ef2715dd39200d21f91436cc9a0acefc274a8980", "ja": "待ち時間にうたた寝してたことか？", "zh": "是指等候的时候打瞌睡那件事吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_015siz0544_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_015siz0544_1011_015siz", "source_sha256": "74f19fa501b0ea06255d3136722a18cbffca237515069406665e4729c21f659d", "ja": "わ、わかってるじゃないですか！\nあれ、{$P$}のせいですからね！", "zh": "明、明明知道嘛！\n那件事，都怪{$P$}哦！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_015siz0544_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_015siz0544_1012_p", "source_sha256": "58b0e970a7154805b730c7b8b8c1de11e8ba344e7e958f428d8b770162b6c66a", "ja": "えっ？", "zh": "咦？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_015siz0544_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_015siz0544_1013_015siz", "source_sha256": "530396d6334145b5eac9c55c0ed50f5320486195857da7a4664b80751d8cf4c7", "ja": "大事な撮影だから頑張らなきゃって、\n今日はいつも以上に気合いを入れてきたんです。", "zh": "因为是重要的拍摄，所以心想着一定要全力以赴，\n今天才鼓足了比平时更多的干劲过来的。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_015siz0544_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_015siz0544_1014_015siz", "source_sha256": "1a666159f7ddcbee97224523a3dec723f4756ea8e84fb9253a9c5c1a1312ced6", "ja": "それなのに、{$P$}が普段通りで……\nつい、気が緩んでしまって……。", "zh": "可是，{$P$}还是和平时一样……我也不由得放松了下来……。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_015siz0544_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_015siz0544_1015_p", "source_sha256": "51f6180737747e8dc29b801cf723df9c0e76b136449c7e9aa89e63710e03b4aa", "ja": "そ、そうだったのか。わかった。\n撮影が終わるまでは、静香が集中できるようにするよ。", "zh": "原、原来是这样啊。知道了。  \n在拍摄结束之前，我会让静香能够集中精神。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_015siz0544_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_015siz0544_1016_015siz", "source_sha256": "8cbf99cb690843ddc8537a9d228e167be8f29c7cc0f182b66d441a35832eea8e", "ja": "ありがとうございます。\n私も、理不尽なことを言ってるってわかってます。", "zh": "谢谢您。\n我也知道自己说了很不讲理的话。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_015siz0544_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_015siz0544_1017_015siz", "source_sha256": "332d10b234ca316cfe1dac71e53de5daac8c624607f01d621fbbe75622540bf7", "ja": "でも雑誌を見た人達に感じてもらいたいんです。\nこの服のカッコよさを……。", "zh": "可是，我想让看过杂志的人感受到这身衣服有多帅气……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_015siz0544_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_015siz0544_1018_015siz", "source_sha256": "0d128f21abfe4a428a2268d7cf36f6215278d14b40ef38727a12c84dc61ff035", "ja": "それをうまく表現できるのは、私だけですから。\n最後までやり切りたいんです。", "zh": "因为只有我能把它完美地表现出来。\n所以，我想坚持到最后。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_015siz0544_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_015siz0544_1019_p", "source_sha256": "a768f4c931810ff9df5325ffd8a4ef23cdd019dcbe8b4853080f76879e3777cd", "ja": "静香の覚悟はわかった。\n今日は静香が納得する写真を撮ろう！", "zh": "我明白静香的觉悟了。今天就拍出让静香满意的照片吧！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_015siz0544_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_015siz0544_1020_015siz", "source_sha256": "252717d6fb77a98bac8219e1a03921974879b7a36eee9efa5c5eb99d9113e3bc", "ja": "はい！　私の思いを込めて……\nこの後も最高の撮影にしてみせます！", "zh": "好的！我会将我的心意融入其中……\n接下来也一定要拍出最棒的照片！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
